comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T19:28:41.305Z",codex-agent,"Bun 1.3.5 raw-socket probes confirm sendDate=false and removeHeader(date) still emit a changing automatic Date. An empty explicit date suppresses generation but is not a valid HTTP date. Evaluating a single fixed valid sentinel Date plus no-store policy for portable, bounded denial headers."
  "2026-10-15T19:32:42.965Z",codex-agent,"Design: a single fixed valid sentinel Date (Unix epoch) plus Cache-Control: no-store on fixed denials under both runtimes. Header state is constant and independent of wall time, process lifetime and repository. Behavioral revert proof: reverting only handleServedRequest to origin/main makes the two native-runtime socket cases fail (0 pass, 2 fail): Node loses the documented sentinel and Bun wire bytes change across 1.15 seconds. Fixed socket cases both pass. No catalogue routing change is part of this fix."
  "2026-10-15T19:35:13.203Z",codex-agent,Linked pm test execution passed 2/2 with native Node and Bun worker processes and raw TCP response equality. Project test-result tracking is disabled; results are recorded in this comment.
  "2026-10-15T21:04:41.967Z",codex-agent,Complete npm release check at e03471b passed 1541/1541 with zero fail/cancel/skip/todo and per-file 100% coverage across all 65 source files. Both native Node and native Bun cross-second raw-socket denial regressions passed inside the full run. The full Bun-invoked command is being repeated after a separate existing erasure-setup failure.
  "2026-10-15T21:35:24.411Z",codex-agent,"Delivery gates at e03471b: both complete npm and Bun release checks exited 0, each 1541/1541 with 0 fail/cancel/skip/todo and per-file 100% coverage across all 65 source files. Native Node and Bun raw TCP denial responses match across 1.15 seconds with the documented sentinel Date/no-store policy. Revert proof remains recorded above. Earlier unrelated erasure refusal is tracked in pm-vcs-simi; no test or threshold was relaxed. Release claim, keep in_progress."
  "2026-10-15T22:13:09.558Z",codex-agent,"Review round 1: probe bun --version before native runtime tests, preserve always-run Node coverage, verify npm test with Bun hidden, and confirm CI installs Bun before coverage. Inspection also found an unconditional Bun consumer loop in test/composition-consumer.test.ts; include it in this Node-only compatibility fix."
  "2026-10-15T22:17:14.139Z",codex-agent,"CI proof: .github/workflows/ci.yml installs Bun 1.3.14 using oven-sh/setup-bun before npm run coverage in both Node matrix jobs. The denial-wire Bun case is therefore enabled there. Local focused run executed Node and native Bun denial-wire cases, 2/2 pass; config and legacy coverage also passed 9/9. Both consumer Bun scenarios now use explicit skip metadata only when bun --version fails."
  "2026-10-15T22:18:12.473Z",codex-agent,"Linked PM denial-wire verification passed 1/1 command, executing both Node and native Bun cases (2/2 tests). Project test-result tracking is disabled, so this comment records the results."
  "2026-10-16T00:29:21.512Z",codex-agent,"Both full release gates passed at a124253: 1554/1554 tests each, zero failures or skips and 100% statements/branches/functions/lines over 65 sources. The first full Node-only npm test had 1549 passed, 1 failed and 4 expected Bun skips. Its sole failure was the unchanged served-forge fixture's real 60000 ms lease expiring before final push after 86 seconds. The focused Node-only case passed. Follow-up pm-vcs-forgeleaseexpiry tracks fixture timing; retrying the exact full Node-only command without source edits or changed thresholds."
  "2026-10-16T00:48:08.061Z",codex-agent,"Final Node-only acceptance: env PATH=\"$NVM_BIN:/usr/bin:/bin\" npm test passed unchanged on full retry: 1554 total, 1550 passed, 0 failed/cancelled/todo, 4 explicit Bun-only skips (built consumer, packed consumer, denial-wire worker, globally installed served CLI). The always-run Node cases passed. The unchanged served-forge case passed in 57.810 seconds; its initial lease-expiry failure remains recorded in pm-vcs-forgeleaseexpiry. Both release gates had 1554/1554 passed and zero skips, proving the native Bun paths execute when available."
  "2026-10-21T19:05:18.072Z",codex-agent,"Tracker reconciliation authorized for the audited verdict FIXED-STALE. Re-verified unchanged main 27e1d84671fa: delivery 1efdf4b3ca0d remains in main ancestry; engine/config.ts, test/composition-consumer.test.ts remain present. Honor disabled HTTP Date headers when serving with native Bun. [PR #114](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-vcs/pull/114) (1efdf4b) disambiguates parent object-fetch endpoints, suppresses HTTP Date under Bun when requested, and fails closed on unreadable existing configuration; real transport regressions are committed. Scope: tracker state only; no new runtime certification or deployment claim."
